<section class="cs__sec" aria-labelledby="s1">
  <p class="st-k rv">01 · Research</p>
  <h2 class="cs__h rv" id="s1">What we learned</h2>
  <p class="cs__p rv">
    Watching the queue was more useful than any survey. People hesitated at the same two moments,
    every time.
  </p>
  <p class="cs__p rv">
    I kept the research small and specific: a handful of conversations, a look at the real data, and
    one afternoon watching people use the current product. Each finding went on a card with the
    exact words people used.
  </p>
</section>
