  <p class="st-k rv">02 · Design</p>
  <h2 class="cs__h rv" id="s2">How the design came together</h2>
  <p class="cs__p rv">
    Everything important sits in the lower two thirds of the screen. Photos lead, text follows, and
    the order summary is always visible.
  </p>
