<section class="cs__sec" aria-labelledby="s3">
  <p class="st-k rv">03 · Build</p>
  <h2 class="cs__h rv" id="s3">Getting it built</h2>
  <p class="cs__p rv">
    The kiosk runs the same components as the web ordering flow, so menu changes happen once.
  </p>
  <p class="cs__p rv">
    Engineers were in the review from the first prototype, so the states, empty screens and error
    cases were agreed before the build started.
